faqs.answer:
Open the file, loop while the return value is not `-1`, and close the handle when you are done. Pair the call with `feof` or compare against `-1` directly:

```matlab
fid = fopen('data.txt', 'r');
while ~feof(fid)
    line = fgets(fid);
    if line == -1, break; end
    fprintf('%s', line);
end
fclose(fid);
```
